![Asfel n Ufdu ɣ wemkan-nneɣ (2): Afdu ɣ Urkawal Amaynu.. d ssuq n isemgan](/images/posts/nt-redemption-shi.png)

> «Acku Yiwis n wemdan awd nettan ur d-yucki ad as-qddcen mdden, mac yucka-d ad isker taqeddact, yefk iman-ns d asfel n ufdu ɣ wemkan n kigan» (Marqus 10: 45).


Nsmed ɣ umagrad amezwaru ɣ yat tideț n Tira Iqedsen ur itteqbaln amcawaṛ: Nga imerwasiyen i lḥqq amutay n Yakuc, ur illi wesserḥ neɣ aslelli f fabuṛ; Aslelli ira yan "Wali" (bab n lḥqq) izḍarn ad ibedd ɣ wemkan-nneɣ yefk atig ikemlen i lḥqq n Yakuc. Ɣid a ɣ d-tfeɣ tifawt n Linjil f tgellidit n Rrum lli ɣ llan isemgan d yat tgezzumt imqqurn ɣ wamun. Ɣ waddad ad, istiy Ṛṛuḥ Iqedsen tguriwin ibaynn d ismden aḥma ad aɣ-isfru mad isker Lmasiḥ.

Ma iga watig lli ityufkan d asfel n ufdu?

Afeɣ zɣ ssuq

Iḍrissan d imarajiɛ

## Tutlayt tayunanit d ssuq n isemgan (Lutron)

Iɣ nɣra taguri n "Afdu" neɣ "Asfel n ufdu" (Lutron) ɣ Urkawal Amaynu, izḍaṛ ad d-yack s uqerruy n umeɣri n ɣilad ɣir "Asellek" amutay. Mac afham ad iqṣer bahra 1.

Ɣ umaḍal ayunani d urumi, tawja n tguriwin lli izdin d usfel n ufdu (Zun d: Lutron - lutrun) ur jju tyawseqdcent s unamk n usellek iɛrran f watig. Mac tga yat tguri n tzznza d lqanun lli ityawseqdacen ɣ "ssuq n isemgan". Asfel n ufdu (Lutron) iga t: Atig lli ittyufkan aḥma ad ittuslelli ismeg d ad t-id-yawi zɣ lhala-ns, neɣ atig lli ittyufkan aḥma ad d-ifsi unḥbus n lgirra.

Manik s ar ittuwskar uslelli n ismeg zik? Ɣ lqanun n uzemz an, ur izḍar ismeg ad ikseb ayla isuln f ufus-ns; aylli ismun iga ayla n bab-ns s lqanun. F ɣayad, mqqar izḍar ismeg ad ismun atig n usfel-ns yefk t i bab-ns aḥma ad isɣ tilelli-ns, bab-ns izḍar s lqanun ad yameẓ aqariḍ an zun d ayla-ns ula nettan d ad isɣama ismeg ɣ tsemganeț! Aḥma ad iffeɣ zɣ lweḥla yad n lqanun, ar itteddu ismeg yefk aqariḍ-ns ɣ texzant n kra n lqṣer n wida ssaɣn id-yakucn. Sinna ar isɣa lkahn ismeg i yakuc awtani. Nnatija ɣid tga is ismeg iffeɣ kullu zɣ ddu ufus n bab-ns akalan, mac ɣ tizi an nit ar ittegga "Aderfi n yakuc an, ɣ tizi an nit iga ayla-ns" 2. Ismeg iḥtaja ad yili "Wis kṛaḍ iḥurran" (Yakuc/Lkahn) lli rad ikcem ɣ tɣawsa n lqanun idmen is d-nṭaqal tilit s lqanun.

Ɣid ar nttanni Aḥader n Yakuc ifelnn d imsewhem; zun d manik s iseqdec Yakuc ccarayeɛ n Urkawal Aqdim d tmatarin-ns aḥma ad iheggi iqerruyen n wudayn ad qbeln "Amfadi", ɣikad nit iseqdec nniḍam n "ssuq n isemgan" d iwarratn imẓlayn n uslelli ɣ tɣerma tayunanit d trumit aḥma ad iheggi iqerruyen n leǧnas nniḍen ad fehmen tamsart tagellidt n uslelli ɣ umezruy! Leslak amasiḥi ur igi ɣir "Mersum n ssmaḥ" d-yuckan zɣ ignwan, mac iga "Taɣawsa n tisɣi" n tideț yefka gis Lmasiḥ atig n usfel-nneɣ aḥma ad aɣ iserḥ zɣ tsemganeț n ubkkaḍu aḥma ad ng ayla-ns kullu. Zun d ɣiklli inna uṛṛasul: «Acku tettyawseɣam s watig. F ɣayad, fkat tamanegt i Yakuc ɣ tggaṛiwin-nnun d ɣ wida-nnun, lli igan ayla n Yakuc» (1 Kurintus 6: 20).

## Asekkin n tjerrumt isbeggen tideț n "Asfel ɣ wemkan-nneɣ" (Anti = Ɣ wemkan n)

Inna Sidi Yesu: «Acku Yiwis n wemdan awd nettan ur d-yucki ad as-qddcen mdden, mac yucka-d ad isker taqeddact, yefk iman-ns d asfel n ufdu ɣ wemkan n [anti-lutron] kigan» (Marqus 10: 45, Matta 20: 28). Taguri tayunanit lli ittyuṭerjamn s "ɣ wemkan n" ɣid tga asekkin n tjerrumt (anti - anti) ɣ tguri ismuttlen (anti-lutron) 3.

Asekkin ad n tjerrumt (lli istti Ṛṛuḥ Iqedsen s tṣeddit ɣ Uweḥḥi) ar isbeggan cceɣl n Sidi Yesu s usfel n iman-ns ɣ wemkan-nneɣ. Ɣ tutlayt tayunanit, ur isnummel usekkin (anti) ɣir "f wudem n neɣ i nnfeɛ" n kra n wemdan, mac isnummel s useqweṣṣdi aggar n kra neɣ wemdan ɣ wemkan n wemdan nniḍen: "Ɣ wemkan n" (In place of / In exchange for). Amedya lli yufn ɣ tṣeddit n tutlayt zɣ Ttarjama Tasebɛinit iga asekkin n lḥqq aqeḍɛawi: «Tiṭ ɣ wemkan n (anti) tiṭ» 4. Tga taɣawsa n unbeddal ikemlen.

Ɣid ar inemla Urkawal Amaynu d nnebuat tagellidt n (Icaɛya 53). Tiguriwin n Lmasiḥ ar d-ssktaynt qbala tawlaft n "Ismeg illan ɣ leɛtab" lli yusin ibkkaḍn n wiyyaḍ: «Winn d ittyugas f wudem n ibkkaḍn-nneɣ, ittyerẓa f wudem n lxeṭiyat-nneɣ, asguri n sslam-nneɣ fllas a illi... Irs Yakuc fllas abkkaḍu-nneɣ kullutn... acku ițwut f wudem n ubkkaḍu n wegdud-inu... d lxeṭiyat-nsn ibbi-tn f uyyis-ns... iwsi abkkaḍu n kigan isafeɛ ɣ imednuben» (Icaɛya 53: 5-12). Awal ad (Anti-lutron) ar issfḍ kraygat awtuf aḥma ad iffeɣ umidag zɣ lɛiqab-ns amsebeddal! Lmasiḥ ur d-yucki ad yili ɣ leɛtab "d neɣ" zun d tawisi ɣ imerṛayn-nneɣ, mac yucka-d ad ittyugas d ittyerẓa d ițwut ɣ wemkan-nneɣ, ɣ wemkan ad nettut nkkʷni f wudem n ibkkaḍn-nneɣ lli yusi fllas ɣ wemkan-nneɣ. Ibedd Lmasiḥ ɣ wemkan lli ɣ nețṣaweq ad nbedd, ittyuḥkam fllas zun d bu ubkkaḍu iwsi lḥisab lli istahell kuyan gisnɣ, ițwaɛaqab s lɛiqab-nneɣ istahelln d iḥeqqan.

Ar ittekkid uṛṛasul Bulus anamek ad s tzmert ɣ (1 Timutawus 2: 6) ɣilli ɣ isnummel Lmasiḥ s mas iga: «Willi yefkan iman-ns d asfel n ufdu ɣ wemkan n kullu mdden». Taguri lli ittyuseqdacen ɣid tga nit taguri ismuttlen (Anti-lutron - anti lutrun) tga tt "asfel n ufdu ɣ wemkan n kullu mdden", lli ittyuṭerjamn ɣ teɣzi-ns: "asfel n ufdu ɣ wemkan-nneɣ".

Zun d ɣiklli inna Bulus ula nettan: «Willi ittyufkan i lmut f wudem n ibkkaḍn-nneɣ d inker f wudem n asisg n Lḥqq n Rbbi ɣ igʷgi-nneɣ» (Rumya 4: 25). Ittyufka Lmasiḥ i lḥisab n lmut "f wudem n ibkkaḍn-nneɣ" (asekkin n tjerrumt ayunani Dia "f wudem n" isbeggen "Asebba" tga tt: f ssebt n ibkkaḍn-nneɣ) 5; gan ibkkaḍn-nneɣ ssebt lli iḥetmen ad ittyufka usfel ad n ufdu ɣ wemkan-nneɣ.

Lmasiḥ ur irẓem taggurt n lḥebs ad aɣ inecceṭ s tuffra, mac ikcem nettan s lḥebs, yameẓ amkan-nneɣ, yefk lxeṭiyț tikemliyn i lḥqq n Yakuc s leɛtab-ns d lmut-ns f umidag, neffeɣ d nkkʷni nga iderfiyen s "uzref aqeḍɛawi ikemlen" d "axlq amaynu".

## Ma iga watig lli ityufkan d asfel n ufdu?

Nẓṛa ɣ Urkawal Aqdim is asrayli ar ittifka "nnequṛt n uffadu" i Yakuc zun d asfel f iman-ns (Ufuɣ 30). Mac, ɣ Urkawal Amaynu, ma iga watig lli ittyufkan aḥma ad d-nețsɣa zɣ ssuq n isemgan?

Irra Buṭrus uṛṛasul s uṣeddi ɣ (1 Buṭrus 1: 18-19):

> «Tssnem is tettyufdam ur d s tɣawsiwin lli ittfanan, s nnequṛt neɣ uṛɣ... mac s idammen iɛzzan, zun d id illi n ugerram ur igin bu lɛib neɣ ddnns, idammen n Lmasiḥ».

Ur igi watig iqaridn ittfanan, mac iga tudert n Yiwis n Yakuc lli iggʷan aksum; atig iga «...idammen n Lmasiḥ, lli s Ṛṛuḥ n bda yefkan iman-ns i Yakuc war lɛib...» (Ibraniyen 9: 14). Idammen ɣ Tira Iqedsen gisn tudert, zun d ɣiklli ittekkid Uweḥḥi iqedsen: «Acku rruḥ n weksum tella ɣ idammen, ɣikann a f awn tt-fkiɣ f uṭaṛiṭ n usfel aḥma ad ifdu ṛṛuḥ-nnun, acku idammen ad ifdun ṛṛuḥ» (Ilawiyen 17: 11). Ɣid ur iqṣi ad nettu tisɣi tamsbeddalt lli ibaynn ɣ wawal n "aḥma ad ifdu ṛṛuḥ-nnun"; lmut (azzal n idammen) tga asfel n ufdu ahidut waḥdut f ibkkaḍn-nneɣ d uɛeṣṣi-nneɣ f Uxamluc. Aḥma ad nili ɣ tlelli, ikka tt inn flli-nneɣ ad yili ufdu yad d utig yad n tderfit. Izri Wawali (Lmasiḥ) yefk tudert-ns d idammen-ns igan iɣsan d (Asfel n ufdu ɣ wemkan n - Anti-lutron) aḥma ad issefreḥ iṭalabn n tsɣudt d lḥqq n Babaneɣ s tkemlit.

F ɣayad, lliɣ ittekkid uṛṛasul Bulus: «Ar as-ittawḥasab Lḥqq n Lmasiḥ s lfeḍl f fabuṛ s usfel n ufdu illan ɣ Yesu Lmasiḥ» (Rumya 3: 24), ar aɣ issktay is asisg n Lḥqq n Rbbi "f fabuṛ" d ayla-nneɣ nkkʷni waḥdut, acku ur nefki walu, mac ur igi f fabuṛ mqqar imikk f Yakuc; ikellf as kullu mad illan. Ɣikad iga "Usbeddel amsewhem" lli s tettyurajja Tejmaɛt icerqiyen ɣ tẓalliwin-ns ar ttini: "Nkkʷni ad iskern lxeṭya is ittyuɛteb nettan. Nkkʷni ad igan imerwasiyen i lḥqq iqedsen s ibkkaḍn-nneɣ d nettan ad ixelsen amerwas ɣ igʷgi-nneɣ" 6. Nga isemgan imerwasiyen, iga nettan Sidi lli ifkan atig n usfel-nneɣ s idammen-ns zddignin!

## Afeɣ zɣ ssuq

Iwaln lli iseqdec Uweḥḥi aḥma ad isbeggen Asfel n ufdu (Lutron) d Asfel n ufdu ɣ wemkan-nneɣ (Anti-Lutron) ar aɣ issefraw s tṣeddit imqqurn is leslak-nneɣ ittyuskar s uceɣl "amḍfaq ɣ wemkan-nneɣ" lli ɣ ittyufka yan watig ɣlayn "idammen n Yiwis" (1 Yuḥanna 1: 7), neɣ zun d ɣiklli inna uṛṛasul Bulus "Idammen n Yakuc" lliɣ isawal d imɣaṛn n Ifsus: «...aḥma ad tksm tajmaɛt n Yakuc lli isɣa s idammen-ns» (Imawlan 20: 28), aḥma ad aɣ isellek zɣ tsemganeț afad ad ngg ayla n Yakuc.

Ɣ umagrad d-yuckan rad nɣezzif ɣ tɣuri n tguriwin n Urkawal Amaynu lli izdin d ufdu.

Ɣer ula ɣ tsuddest n usfel n ufdu ɣ wemkan-nneɣ:

Agezzum amezwaru: Afdu ɣ Urkawal Aqdim.. Ma iga lwali?

## Iḍrissan d imarajiɛ

## Morris, Lyon. Lkraza taṛṛasulit s umidag (The Apostolic Preaching of the Cross), Agezzum amezwaru: Afdu.

## Ar issefraw umassan n tutlayt Adolf Deissmann is tamsart ad tetyawssan zik s yism n (Sacral Manumission).

## Ar ittekkid d. Lqiss Ɣassan Xalaf ɣ umawal-ns n tguriwin tiyunanin is aseqdec n tguri "Anti-lutron" ar isbeggen tilit n usfel n ufdu zun d amsebeddal ikemlen, ɣilli ɣ ittamẓ umfadi amkan n wida ittyufdan.

## Ttarjama tasebɛinit tga ttarjama tayunanit n Urkawal Aqdim (Ilawiyen 24: 20).

## Ar issefraw lqiss Ɣassan Xalaf is asekkin n tjerrumt (Dia / διά) d waddad n nneṣb ar isbeggen "Asebba" (Because of / On account of), mayad a ittekkidn is gan ibkkaḍn-nneɣ "Ssebt" lli iḥetmen ad ittyufka Lmasiḥ iman-ns d asfel n ufdu ɣ wemkan-nneɣ.

## Tiẓalliwin n tgezzumt iqedsen (Tagezzumt tasuryanit), Liturjiya n tejmaɛt taqibṭit tuṛtuduksit. (Ẓer asit n Anba Takla).

